            Transform Your
            <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-blue-600 to-green-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent"> Digital Presence</span>
            With Our Expert Services
          </h1>
          
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-aos-duration="900" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
            Comprehensive digital marketing solutions designed to boost your online visibility, drive qualified leads, and accelerate business growth across all digital channels.
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
            <a href="#contactForm" class="group relative px-8 py-4 bg-linear-to-r from-blue-600 to-green-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden" data-aos-duration="900" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
              <span class="relative z-10">Get Free Consultation</span>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-blue-700 to-green-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+919507925579" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-gray-800 font-semibold rounded-xl border-2 border-blue-500 hover:border-blue-600 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2" data-aos-duration="900" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
